Chapter: BoundedParamLiteral

 Bounded signatures, stage A: a literal argument provably outside a
 bounded parameter is a hard error (CDX2050), exactly as the same
 literal into a bounded record field. 300 does not inhabit
 Integer between 0 and 255, so the call is rejected at type-check
 time.

Section: Definitions

  inc-byte : Integer between 0 and 255 -> Integer
  inc-byte (n) = n + 1

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni (integer-to-text (inc-byte 300))
  end
